From e60b61bfd190e97af4924dfa337ba2592bdfa45d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex PoC <codex-poc@invalid.example>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:30:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] Restore lock-screen notification privacy control

Port the notification opt-in state, setter, toggle, and unavailable-push explanation from the pinned Molly UnifiedPush target. The control remains opt-in and reports the current effective setting only when push delivery is available.
